    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/HttpRequestMethodNotSupportedException.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web\">HttpRequestMethodNotSupportedException</a></code> - if the <a href=\"../core/mapping/ResourceType.html\" title=\"enum class in org.springframework.data.rest.core.mapping\"><code>ResourceType</code></a> does not support the given\n            <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/http/HttpMethod.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.http\"><code>HttpMethod</code></a>. Will contain all supported methods as indicators for clients.",
